{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And Abram said.</b> Since there was an interruption in between, it returns and says <b>and Abram said</b> — similar to ״ויאמר אליו לבן ויאמר נקבה שכרך,״ ״ויאמר מלך מצרים ויאמר בילדכן,״ and many more in Scripture." "<b>And behold, the son of my house inherits me.</b> Even though You said to me 'to your seed I give this land,' I am old, advanced in days, and Eliezer, who is <b>the son of my house</b> — he <b>inherits me</b>, for the child I may bear from now on will remain after my death young and tender, and Eliezer will do as he pleases with everything. And the Holy One, blessed be He, answered him: 'What issues from your loins — he shall inherit you,' and he shall have full possession of all your possessions.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:04:18.434867907Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}